Package: luci-app-watchplug
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: luci-base, jshn
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: luci
Category: LuCI
Maintainer: Watchplug
Description: Watchplug - drive an HTTP-controlled device from the connectivity
 state of a router interface. Pings out of the monitored device itself, so a
 failover route cannot hide the outage; after a configurable delay it cycles the
 device off and back on, retrying until the link returns. Optional backoff and
 cycle cap. Built-in Tasmota support, or free-form URLs for any other HTTP
 device. Fully configurable from LuCI.
